# --- Designer source bundles ---
# .design_pkg/ stays tracked as the canonical brand reference. Block
# accidental re-imports of secondary copies, archives, and tarballs.
.design_pkg[0-9]*/
.design_pkg/pkg.tar.gz
.design_pkg/package.bin
.design_pkg/package.unzipped
*Design System*.zip
*Design System*.tar.gz
